{"id":686,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"By exposing foes to the blinking of its luminescent spots, Inkay demoralizes them, and then it seizes the chance to flee."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It spins while making its luminescent spots flash. These spots allow it to communicate with others by using different patterns of light."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When exchanging information with others of its kind, it flashes the light-emitting spots on its body in a complex rhythm."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It draws prey near with its blinking lights and then wraps them up in its long tentacles and holds them in place."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"It flashes the light-emitting spots on its body, which drains its opponent’s will to fight. It takes the opportunity to scuttle away and hide."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"Opponents who stare at the flashing of the light-emitting spots on its body become dazed and lose their will to fight."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Contrary","hidden":false,"description":"Reverses any stat changes affecting the Pokémon so that attempts to boost its stats instead lower them—and attempts to lower its stats will boost them."},{"name":"Suction Cups","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon uses suction cups to stay in one spot. This protects it from moves and items that would force it to switch out."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Water 2"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Tentacles","evolution":{"id":686,"name":"Inkay","condition":null,"children":[{"id":687,"name":"Malamar","condition":"Lv. 30, with the console upside down","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,64],[3,95],[6,35],[9,371],[12,365],[15,60],[18,207],[21,163],[24,400],[27,427],[31,415],[33,492],[36,576],